# Cloudflare Pages _redirects
#
# Astro builds static per-route HTML files, so a SPA wildcard fallback is NOT
# needed. Each canonical route (/, /work, /resume, /contact, etc.) has its own
# index.html in dist/.
#
# Format: <source>  <destination>  <status>

/projects  /work/  301
/projects/  /work/  301
/projects/*  /work/:splat  301
/case-studies  /work/  301
/case-studies/  /work/  301
/case-studies/*  /work/:splat  301
